# Deflecting Palm (CR 609.7a, 615.5, 615.8): Bot1 casts it in response to Bot2's Shock aimed at Bot1 and chooses that Shock - a
# spell on the stack, not a permanent - as the source. Shock's 2 damage to Bot1 is prevented, and the Palm deals that much to
# the source's controller, Bot2. Bot1 stays at 20; Bot2 ends at 18, the damage recorded as the Palm's.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Deflecting Palm
Island x25

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Shock
Island x25

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Shock.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Deflecting Palm.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Stack.Shock)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 0
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot2.Life = 18
Prevented = 2 Shock > Bot1 by Deflecting Palm
